      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_12",
      "quote": "Only 1 report was unable to be retrieved in a full-text English language version.",
      "reason": "The text notes that one report could not be retrieved in English, implying that language was a criterion for eligibility assessment."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_8_e6",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_6",
      "quote": "Records identified from electronic databases and other sources described were downloaded and stored in EndNote software version X9. All records were screened for duplication by the principal reviewer (SM) using EndNote tools",
      "reason": "The text describes the use of EndNote software for duplicate removal, which is an automation tool in the selection process."
    },
    {
